Gump RPM
========

Copyright (C) 2026 Alexander R. Croft
Licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later. A commercial license is available at
https://frogfish.io.

This package is intentionally inert. It installs /usr/bin/gump and nothing
else. It does not create users, directories, configuration, secrets, sockets,
or services, and it does not start Gump.

Captain is responsible for configuring the host and installing Gump as a
service with the cluster-specific identity, credentials, limits, and bootstrap
parameters.
